# Utilities slice 1 — a brownout and its recovery, on the ridge in ridge.borough.
#
#   godot --path src/Borough.Godot -- --load plans/evidence/utilities-slice-1/ridge.borough \
#     --drive plans/evidence/utilities-slice-1/brownout.drive
#
# The saved city opens on Day 2, fully delivered: a plant in the west District, an occupied
# dwelling in the east, and one Street crossing the boundary between them. Tiles are in
# ridge.geometry.txt, which the fixture writes beside the save.
#
# Two cameras. The wide one holds the whole ridge, west plant to east dwelling, so the Districts
# can be compared. The close one stands over the occupied dwelling, where the selected Building's
# panel and its massing are in one frame.
#
# ⚠ ONE `shoot` PER TICK, AND THE CAMERA MOVES ON THE TICK IT SHOOTS. `_pendingShot` holds one
# path and the picture is taken on the NEXT frame, so a second `shoot` on the same Tick throws the
# first away and a camera restored after a `shoot` lands in that shot. Hence the gaps.
4097 pause
4097 overlay utilities
4097 ui building 37
4097 ui section utilities on
4097 turn left
4097 tilt 40
4097 focus 128 2 560
4097 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-1/01-day2-full.png
4097 speed 8
4099 pause
4099 tilt 45
4099 focus 225 3 90
4099 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-1/02-day2-full-close.png
4099 speed 8

# The trigger: the one crossing Street goes. The Day's delivered fraction was fixed by the settle
# at Tick 4,096, so the reading does not move until the next one.
4101 pause
4101 tilt 40
4101 focus 128 2 560
4101 hold street
4101 click 191 0 shift
4101 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-1/03-street-removed.png
4101 speed 8

# The settle at Tick 6,144 reads a road graph with no crossing in it. Day 3 runs at nothing
# delivered, and the dwelling is browned out without a single Rule stopping.
6150 pause
6150 hold look
6150 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-1/04-day3-dark.png
6150 speed 8
6152 pause
6152 tilt 45
6152 focus 225 3 90
6152 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-1/05-day3-dark-close.png
6152 speed 8

# The repair: the same two Nodes joined again.
6154 pause
6154 tilt 40
6154 focus 128 2 560
6154 hold street
6154 click 160 0
6154 click 192 0
6154 speed 8
6156 pause
6156 hold look
6156 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-1/06-street-relaid.png
6156 speed 8

# The settle at Tick 8,192 finds the link back. Day 4 is whole again.
8200 pause
8200 shoot plans/evidence/utilities-slice-1/07-day4-restored.png
8200 quit
